[{"answer":"Joe, you know I'm giving a presentation in our film studies class next week?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, could we discuss it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/3.mp3"},{"answer":"I could do with getting someone else's opinion.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Of course, Katie. What are you going to talk about?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/5.mp3"},{"answer":"It's about film adaptations of Shakespeare's plays.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/6.mp3"},{"answer":"I've got very interested in all the different approaches that film directors take.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/7.mp3"},{"answer":"So I thought I'd start with Giannetti, who's a professor of film and literature,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/8.mp3"},{"answer":"and in one of his books he came up with a straightforward classification of film adaptations","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/9.mp3"},{"answer":"based on how faithful they are to the original plays and novels.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/10.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/11.mp3"},{"answer":"I've already made some notes on that,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/12.mp3"},{"answer":"so I just need to sort those out before the presentation.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/13.mp3"},{"answer":"I thought that next I'd ask the class to come up with the worst examples of Shakespeare adaptations that they've seen,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/14.mp3"},{"answer":"and to say why.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/15.mp3"},{"answer":"That should be more fun than having their favourite versions.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/16.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I can certainly think of a couple!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/18.mp3"},{"answer":"Next I want to talk about Rachel Malchow.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/19.mp3"},{"answer":"I came across something on the internet about her work on film adaptations,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/20.mp3"},{"answer":"and I was thinking of showing some film clips to illustrate her ideas.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Will you have enough time, though?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Both to prepare and during the presentation?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/23.mp3"},{"answer":"After all, I doubt if you'll be able to find all the clips you want.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/24.mp3"},{"answer":"Perhaps you're right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/25.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, well, I'd better do some slides instead,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/26.mp3"},{"answer":"saying how various films relate to what she says.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/27.mp3"},{"answer":"That should encourage discussion.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/28.mp3"},{"answer":"Next I want to say something about how plays may be chosen for adaptation","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/29.mp3"},{"answer":"because they're concerned with issues of the time when the film is made.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/30.mp3"},{"answer":"You mean things like patriotism, or the role of governments?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/31.mp3"},{"answer":"Exactly.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/32.mp3"},{"answer":"It's quite tricky, but I've got a few ideas I'd like to discuss.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/33.mp3"},{"answer":"And finally I want to talk about a few adaptations that I think illustrate a range of approaches,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/34.mp3"},{"answer":"and make some comments on them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/35.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you know the Japanese film Ran?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/36.mp3"},{"answer":"I haven't seen it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/37.mp3"},{"answer":"It was based on Shakespeare's King Lear, wasn't it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/38.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/39.mp3"},{"answer":"It was a very loose adaptation, using the same situation and story,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/40.mp3"},{"answer":"but moving it to 16th century Japan instead of 16th century Britain.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/41.mp3"},{"answer":"So for example the king's daughters become sons,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/42.mp3"},{"answer":"because in Japanese culture at that time, women couldn't succeed to the throne.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/43.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/44.mp3"},{"answer":"I hope you're going to talk about the 1993 film of Much Ado About Nothing.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/45.mp3"},{"answer":"I think that's one of the best Shakespeare films.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/46.mp3"},{"answer":"It really brings the play to life, doesn't it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/47.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I agree.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/48.mp3"},{"answer":"And I think filming it in Italy, where the play is set,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/49.mp3"},{"answer":"makes you see what life was like at the time of the play.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/50.mp3"},{"answer":"Absolutely. Right, what's next?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/51.mp3"},{"answer":"Er, next, I thought Romeo & Juliet, the 1996 film,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/52.mp3"},{"answer":"which moves the action into the present day.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/53.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, it worked really well, I thought -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/54.mp3"},{"answer":"changing the two feuding families in the original to two competing business empires,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/55.mp3"},{"answer":"even though they're speaking in the English of the original play.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/56.mp3"},{"answer":"You'd expect it would sound really bizarre,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/57.mp3"},{"answer":"but I found I soon got used to it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/58.mp3"},{"answer":"Me too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/59.mp3"},{"answer":"Then I thought I'd include a real Hollywood film,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/60.mp3"},{"answer":"one that's intended to appeal to a mass commercial audience.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/61.mp3"},{"answer":"There must be quite a number of those.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/62.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, but I've picked the 1996 film of Hamlet.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/63.mp3"},{"answer":"It included every line of the text,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/64.mp3"},{"answer":"but it's more like a typical action hero movie -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/65.mp3"},{"answer":"there are loads of special effects, but no unifying interpretation of the play.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/66.mp3"},{"answer":"All show and no substance.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/67.mp3"},{"answer":"Exactly.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/68.mp3"},{"answer":"Then there's Prospero's Books, based on The Tempest.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/69.mp3"},{"answer":"That was really innovative, from a stylistic point of view.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/70.mp3"},{"answer":"Didn't it include dance and singing and animation, as well as live actors?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/71.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, it did.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/72.mp3"},{"answer":"I also want to mention Looking for Richard.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/73.mp3"},{"answer":"Did you ever see it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/74.mp3"},{"answer":"No, but I've read about it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/75.mp3"},{"answer":"It was a blend of a documentary with a few scenes from Richard III, wasn't it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/76.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/77.mp3"},{"answer":"It's more a way of looking into how people nowadays connect with the playwright -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/78.mp3"},{"answer":"the play is really just the starting point.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/79.mp3"},{"answer":"And that'll be where I finish.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/80.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, it sounds as though it'll be very interesting.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-3-2023-06-02-09-41-14/81.mp3"}]
